# Regenerate with: VHS_NO_SANDBOX=true vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1120
Set Height 690
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Sleep 500ms
Type "pz demo --brief"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Screenshot docs/demo.png
Sleep 6s
